## ObjectType: Settlement Instruction

Required transfer quantity and contractual due date for a fill under the fictional weekday T+2 convention.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| instruction_id | Instruction Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | instruction_id |
| trade_id | Trade Id | string | Foreign key to securities_transactions; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | trade_id |
| due_date | Due Date | date | Contractual date under this sample’s fictional T+2 weekday convention; not a legal market-specific settlement rule. | due_date |
| required_quantity | Required Quantity | decimal | Positive business quantity in the linked instrument’s share or face units. | required_quantity |
| currency | Currency | string | Instrument denomination; must agree across trade, instruction, opening and position. | currency |

### Keys

Primary Keys: instruction_id
Display Key: instruction_id
